	(text "SKB pins 1-36 -> 5x 74HCT165 (frame bit k = SKB pin k+1, then 1010 signature).\n2x 74HCT595 -> SKB 38, 40-50; 2N7002 contact-closure SAMPLE on SKB 39.\nSKB 37 = DVM earth / logic 0 = GND_ISO. See README.md for the bit map."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130 177 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5a8b4eae-1644-5677-8c38-72029e9dbe19")
	)
	(text "Solartron 7075 USB interface\nRP2354A USB interface for the Solartron 7075 DVM + 70754 Parallel BCD Interface (SKB, 50-way Cannon).\nEverything to/from the meter is opto-isolated: only SCK, MOSI, LATCH, OE_N, MISO and DRDY cross the barrier.\nNets are joined by name (global labels). GND (USB side) and GND_ISO (DVM side) are never joined."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 15 0)
